soc-repo Kconfig: ARM_PARAVIRT_SMMU_V3 depends on IOMMU_API instead of selecting it

6.18 VIDEO_QCOM_VENUS 'depends on IOMMU_API' and 'select QCOM_SCM'; with this entry's
'depends on QCOM_SCM' + 'select IOMMU_API' Kconfig reports a recursive dependency and
'make gki_defconfig' with the soc-repo hook aborts. IOMMU_API is =y in gki_defconfig, so
the depends form changes no value.

--- a/bsp612/soc-repo/drivers/iommu/Kconfig
+++ b/bsp612/soc-repo/drivers/iommu/Kconfig
@@ -216,7 +216,7 @@
         tristate "Paravirtualized ARM SMMU V3 driver support"
         depends on ARM64
         depends on QCOM_SCM
-        select IOMMU_API
+        depends on IOMMU_API
         select IOMMU_IO_PGTABLE_LPAE
         select GENERIC_MSI_IRQ_DOMAIN
         help
